可用，\n2025/7月好像重新裝潢有很多優惠活動，\n滿300送50卷（七月送八月底前用完），\n八月慶祝父親節有滿300送30卷，\n這樣根本讓人沒完沒了的想一再來吃😆\n九月有教師節希望也有活動呀！\n第一次來可先進櫃檯前平板點選用餐人數，\n外面有大螢幕可看候位狀況，\n也有app可下載先線上訂位，\n壽司個偏小，醋飯好吃，醬油甜甜不死鹹，\n對胃口不大的女生來說可多吃幾種口味，\n吃過拉麵還好，可點鮭魚壽司跟軍艦手卷，\n他們家的海苔類食材都很好吃，海苔香～\n個頭小剛好一口吃，一上桌要馬上吃，\n有做活動的壽司種類會上比較快，\n八月吃了新品醋溜鰶魚，好吃但忘了拍照，\n反正平板點餐都看得到照片，\n炙燒牛肉有焦香也推推，\n如果不知道吃啥就點八品壽司吧！\n有看到不少一個人來吃的都點烤魚。\n整體而言是I人用餐友善，\n服務可能因為人手不足，沒特別麻煩店員，\n但也沒收服務費，基本平板點餐 新幹線送餐\n一切都很方便，只要折價卷繼續發下去，\n應該會不小心一直回訪吧🤩",null,[0,56]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14076245379452475904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTVjFkWWNGRk9XRm94WVZoR2RrNXNhRFprUlVwV1dsZEpOVm96WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14076245379452475904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTVjFkWWNGRk9XRm94WVZoR2RrNXNhRFprUlVwV1dsZEpOVm96WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14076245379452475904/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTVjFkWWNGRk9XRm94WVZoR2RrNXNhRFprUlVwV1dsZEpOVm96WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14076245379452475904/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTVjFkWWNGRk9XRm94WVZoR2RrNXNhRFprUlVwV1dsZEpOVm96WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14076245379452475904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTVjFkWWNGRk9XRm94WVZoR2RrNXNhRFprUlVwV1dsZEpOVm96WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14076245379452475904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTVjFkWWNGRk9XRm94WVZoR2RrNXNhRFprUlVwV1dsZEpOVm96WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,10900,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SV1dYcFFOWFoxYVhGdk5saDZkRUpWWldJNVozYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa157ba6d663f8d88!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmRWWXpQNXZ1aXFvNlh6dEJVZWI5Z3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SV1dYc